        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Deduplicate Range and StaticRange properties into AbstractRange]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42881</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42881"/>
        <updated>2026-01-23T14:10:43.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/178316747?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">###Description</p>
<p dir="auto">This pull request moves duplicated instance properties from the Range and StaticRange pages into AbstractRange, and updates the child pages to correctly indicate that these properties are inherited.</p>
<p dir="auto">###Motivation</p>
<p dir="auto">According to the DOM specification, collapsed, startContainer, startOffset, endContainer, endOffset, and commonAncestorContainer are defined on AbstractRange and inherited by both Range and StaticRange.<br>
Previously, these properties were documented separately on the Range and StaticRange pages, which caused duplication and inconsistency.<br>
This change aligns MDN documentation with the spec and reduces redundancy for readers.</p>
<p dir="auto">###Additional details</p>
<p dir="auto">Spec references:</p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-abstractrange" rel="nofollow">https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-abstractrange</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-range" rel="nofollow">https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-range</a></p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-staticrange" rel="nofollow">https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-staticrange</a></p>
<p dir="auto">###Related issues and pull requests</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #42760.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3805689409" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42760" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/42760/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/42760">#42760</a></p>]]></content>
